==Translingual==

===Etymology===
Initialism for German ''Ryom''-{{m|de|Verzeichnis||catalog}}.

===Proper noun===
{{head|mul|proper noun}}
# {{lb|mul|music}} Initialism, used in combination with a reference number to indicate a particular work of music by {{w|Antonio Vivaldi}} according to a catalog originally assembled by Danish musicologist {{w|Peter Ryom}}.

